license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Executed reproduction notebook for an interaction-budget-matched analysis
  of compact cross-encoder reranking in hybrid retrieval across eight BEIR
  collections. The artifact preserves source code, narrative, tables, figures,
  and execution outputs while distinguishing cross-encoder interaction count
  from total online latency, memory, and offline storage.
